                        "text": "DBMS supports multiple operations, including data storage, retrieval, updating, and database management. Usually, DBMS communicates with the database using Structured Query Language (SQL). A database management system (DBMS) is primarily used to manage large amounts of data in an organized manner while maintaining data security, consistency, and integrity."
