                            "Meaning: In File System, the users are not required to write procedures. In DBMS, the user has to write procedures for managing databases.",
                            "Sharing: Data is distributed in many files in File System, so it is not easy to share data. Due to centralized nature, data sharing is easy in DBMS.",
